OL,3,GNEWSAQuiet Lane speed change agreed
OL,4,Adespite police concern
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "last piece of the legal jigsaw"
OL,7,Ffor a county's new Quiet Lanes project
OL,8,Fhas been approved, despite concerns
OL,9,Fraised by a police force.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council's plans
OL,12,Finvolve a set of partial road closures
OL,13,Fto traffic using gates or bollards in
OL,14,Forder to create routes for cyclists,
OL,15,Fpedestrians and horse riders when there
OL,16,Fis an alternative available.
OL,18,FThe local authority approved a speed
OL,19,Flimit reduction from 60mph to 20mph on
OL,20,FShepards Pit Lane in Stanton St John on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
