OL,3,GNEWSAQuiet Lane speed change agreed
OL,4,Adespite police concern
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision was the first of its kind
OL,7,Fin the project but came despite
OL,8,Fopposition from Thames Valley Police
OL,9,Fwhich labelled it as "highly
OL,10,Finappropriate".
